  m_Name: TonyDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCDialogue
  npcName: Tony
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b291ac945d95c4ce0909ebad07716615, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - The Name's Tony, it's a pleasure to meet ya.
  - I've heard some things about you... mostly that you're a nuisance to the community
    and a sneaky thief, which is why I had my men hunt you down.
  - Let's cut to the cheese. I'm offering you $1M for the biggest job ever... to
    steal Chef Reggie's iconic secret cheese recipe.
  - Ever since he opened up, all of my customers have abandoned me! I asked one of
    my regulars why...
  - He said the cheese is so good a guy proposed to his pasta last week!!!
